WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:02.000
The beds are fenced with fine net, row by row.

2
00:00:02.300 --> 00:00:04.100
A snail needs damp, shade and green leaves.

3
00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:06.200
Fresh eggs firm up in a tray of water.

4
00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:08.300
Caviar keeps best in a jar on crushed ice.

5
00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:10.400
Serve roe cold, a spoonful at a time.

6
00:00:10.700 --> 00:00:13.100
Then on to the counter of a country shop.
